// Status: STUB — replace with rules/*.modality in Phase 4
// Status: archived experiment notes. Keep examples aligned with the current
// teaching path: avoid formula implication sugar such as `A -> B`, use
// explicit Boolean conditionals such as `!A | B`, and avoid `[+ACTION] true` as a conditional antecedent.
